  <section class="content">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p><strong>Effective date: September 7, 2026</strong><br />
      <strong>Developer: Kroma Digital</strong><br />
      <strong>Application ID: <code>com.kromadigital.myfuturejobs</code></strong></p>

      <p>My Future Jobs: Cambodia is an offline career-education application designed for children aged 5–12.</p>

      <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
      <p>The app does not collect, transmit, sell, or share personal information.</p>
      <p>The app does not require an account and does not request a child’s:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name</li><li>Age</li><li>Email address</li><li>Phone number</li><li>Photos</li><li>Contacts</li><li>Precise or approximate location</li><li>Advertising identifier</li><li>Other device identifiers</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The app contains no advertising SDK, analytics SDK, crash-reporting SDK, in-app purchases, chat, social features, or user-generated content features.</p>

      <h2>2. Information stored on the device</h2>
      <p>The following information may be stored locally on the user’s device:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Language and display settings</li><li>Favorite jobs</li><li>Quiz progress and results</li><li>Daily Challenge progress</li><li>Earned stamps</li><li>Collected job cards</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This information is not sent to Kroma Digital or any third party.</p>
      <p>Android cloud backup and device-transfer backup are disabled for the app.</p>
      <p>Users can remove locally stored information by clearing the app’s storage or uninstalling the app.</p>

      <h2>3. Internet links</h2>
      <p>The app can ask the device’s external browser to open:</p>
      <ul><li>This Privacy Policy</li><li>Publicly available salary-data sources cited in the app</li></ul>
      <p>The browser and destination websites operate under their own privacy policies and practices.</p>
      <p>The app does not embed these websites and does not receive information from them.</p>

      <h2>4. Children’s privacy</h2>
      <p>The app is designed for children aged 5–12 and is designed to avoid collecting personal information from children.</p>
      <p>The app does not contain:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Personalized advertising</li><li>Advertising of any kind</li><li>Account registration</li><li>Analytics or behavioral tracking</li><li>Social or communication features</li><li>User-generated content</li><li>Location tracking</li><li>In-app purchases</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If a future version changes these practices, this Privacy Policy and the Google Play Data safety declaration will be updated before that version is released.</p>

      <h2>5. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>The current version does not include advertising, analytics, billing, crash-reporting, authentication, or social-media SDKs.</p>
      <p>The app uses standard Android and open-source user-interface libraries to provide its offline functionality. These libraries are not configured by Kroma Digital to collect or transmit personal information.</p>

      <h2>6. Data retention and deletion</h2>
      <p>Kroma Digital does not receive or retain personal or learning data from the app.</p>
      <p>Information stored locally remains on the device until the user:</p>
      <ul><li>Clears the app’s storage</li><li>Resets the device</li><li>Uninstalls the app</li></ul>
      <p>Because Kroma Digital does not receive this information, there is no server-side user data requiring a deletion request.</p>

      <h2>7. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>Material changes will be identified by a new effective date.</p>
      <p>This Privacy Policy will remain available at the public URL used in the app and registered in Google Play Console.</p>

      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions can be sent through the Kroma Digital Contact page:</p>
      <p><a href="/contact">https://kroma-digital.pages.dev/contact</a></p>
      <p>Public Privacy Policy URL:</p>
      <p><a href="/privacy/my-future-jobs/">https://kroma-digital.pages.dev/privacy/my-future-jobs/</a></p>

